  "body_html": "<p>¿Cómo estás?</p><p>Soy Aina y esto es Think&amp;Hack.</p><p>Hoy volvemos a los básicos: cómo funciona realmente la memoria en ChatGPT, Gemini y Claude.</p><p>Si te interesa entender antes de implementar, suscríbete para no perderte nada.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Suscríbete ahora&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Suscríbete ahora</span></a></p><div><hr></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aLBM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe759ed2d-6be2-4880-949d-469ef9d16eb7_2816x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aLBM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe759ed2d-6be2-4880-949d-469ef9d16eb7_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aLBM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe759ed2d-6be2-4880-949d-469ef9d16eb7_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aLBM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe759ed2d-6be2-4880-949d-469ef9d16eb7_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aLBM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe759ed2d-6be2-4880-949d-469ef9d16eb7_2816x1536.png 1456w\" 